{"id":8334133,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/1833","number":1833,"state":"merged","title":"max pool v3 dispose precision fail","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/1833","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/1833/issues","body":"## 描述\n场景：Ascend950上aclnnMaxPool接口部分用例在测通路以及精度的场景下，会出现精度对比失败的问题\n原因：aclnnMaxPool接口会调用到max_pool_v3算子，在kernel侧，tilingkey路由错误，导致用例进入错误的模板，导致精度不对\n修改方案：修正max_pool_v3算子在kernel侧，tilingkey路由逻辑\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1032\n\n## 测试\naclnnMaxPool接口，本地白盒验证和网络用例验证测试aclnn通路以及精度，二进制通路精度均通过。\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":8,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c267402134ad667af2b58f","login":"wangyongguang","name":"wangyongguang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ab8479db6d209b3bc340",